        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset MRLRDT Montreal Door Levers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Kwikset Montreal door levers have a ultra sleek contemporary design making it an excellent choice for those who like a more up to date look. The Montreal lever is a non-handed and easy to install.  Fits pre-drilled doors since it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" for door 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick. Available in dummy, passage, privacy and key entry functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/montreal-lever-with-square-rose-kwikset-mrlsqt\"><b>Montreal Square Rose Door Lever</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Montreal Door Lever Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick SmartKey system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed levers.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset Montreal Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry Lever Projection: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive lever for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational lever is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Pushbutton on interior rose engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Montreal Door Lever Set, Kwikset MRLRDT",
                "description": "The Kwikset Montreal door levers have a ultra sleek contemporary design making it an excellent choice for those who like a more up to date look. The Montreal lever is a non-handed and easy to install. Fits all pre-drilled doors since it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for door 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick. Available in dummy, passage, privacy and key entry functions.",
